  Slug: polymath
  DisplayName: Polymath
  IconPath: icons/sundries/books/book-stack.webp
  Description: "Your muse is a jack of all trades, flitting between skills and pursuits.
    Some bards are constantly moved by new muses or draw their inspiration from an
    idealized being, whether it's based on a real person or purely philosophical.
    If your muse is a single creature, it might be an eclectic creature like a fey
    or one who's learned a lot over a long lifespan; if a deity, it might be Desna
    or Calistria. Art inspired by a polymath muse is restless, with each composition
    exhibiting new techniques and an ever-evolving style. As a bard with a polymath
    muse, you are interested in a wide array of topics but rarely dedicated to any
    one, and you rarely make up your mind\u2014you want to try everything. Muse Feat
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Versatile Performance] Muse Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal
    Minion]"
